{
  "pack": "noir",
  "music": {
    "id": "dark-ambient",
    "volume": 0.09
  },
  "ambience": [
    {
      "sfx": "river",
      "from": "s10",
      "to": "s12",
      "volume": 0.22
    },
    {
      "sfx": "piper-flute",
      "from": "s15",
      "to": "s20",
      "volume": 0.3
    },
    {
      "sfx": "eerie-drone",
      "from": "s22",
      "to": "end",
      "volume": 0.14
    }
  ],
  "scenes": [
    {
      "id": "s01",
      "text": "A hundred and thirty children / *vanished* in one day.",
      "template": "type-center",
      "slots": {
        "bigWord": "130"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s02",
      "text": "The town / wrote it *down:*",
      "template": "photo-framed",
      "slots": {
        "photo": {
          "see": "an old handwritten medieval German chronicle page, faded brown ink on parchment",
          "find": [
            "medieval manuscript page german",
            "old chronicle handwritten parchment",
            "medieval parchment handwriting"
          ],
          "kind": "photo",
          "at": "wrote",
          "id": "s02-photo"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s03",
      "text": "June twenty-sixth, / *twelve eighty-four.*",
      "template": "pinned-note"
    },
    {
      "id": "s04",
      "text": "The legend says Hamelin / was drowning / in *rats.*",
      "template": "photo-framed",
      "transition": "blur-dissolve",
      "slots": {
        "photo": {
          "see": "many brown rats crowding together in the dark",
          "find": [
            "rats swarm",
            "brown rats many",
            "rats in cellar"
          ],
          "kind": "photo",
          "at": "start",
          "id": "s04-photo"
        }
      },
      "sfx": [
        {
          "id": "rats-squeak",
          "at": "rats.",
          "volume": 0.45,
          "durMs": 2200
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s05",
      "text": "They bit *babies* / in their cradles.",
      "template": "photo-full",
      "variant": 1,
      "slots": {
        "photo": {
          "see": "an antique wooden rocking cradle, empty, in an old room",
          "find": [
            "antique wooden cradle",
            "old baby cradle dark room",
            "vintage wooden crib"
          ],
          "kind": "photo",
          "at": "start",
          "id": "s05-photo",
          "focus": [
            0.36,
            0.6
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s06",
      "text": "Then a *stranger* came,",
      "template": "type-center"
    },
    {
      "id": "s07",
      "text": "in a coat of many colours, / carrying a *pipe.*",
      "template": "photo-full",
      "slots": {
        "photo": {
          "see": "a man in the Pied Piper's patchwork coat of many colours holding a pipe, on an old cobbled street",
          "find": [
            "pied piper of hamelin illustration",
            "pied piper kate greenaway",
            "rattenfänger von hameln"
          ],
          "kind": "photo",
          "at": "start",
          "id": "s07-photo",
          "focus": [
            0.5,
            0.22
          ]
        }
      },
      "variant": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "s08",
      "text": "For a thousand *guilders,* / he promised,",
      "template": "object-hero",
      "slots": {
        "object": {
          "see": "a few old gold gulden coins, medieval German gold coins",
          "find": [
            "goldgulden coin",
            "gold gulden",
            "medieval gold coin"
          ],
          "kind": "cutout",
          "at": "guilders,",
          "id": "s08-object"
        }
      },
      "sfx": [
        {
          "id": "coin-drop",
          "at": "guilders,",
          "volume": 0.45
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s09",
      "text": "every rat / would be *gone.*",
      "template": "type-center",
      "variant": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "s10",
      "text": "He *played…* / and the rats followed him",
      "template": "object-hero",
      "variant": 1,
      "slots": {
        "object": {
          "see": "an antique wooden pipe or recorder flute, a simple old musical instrument",
          "find": [
            "antique recorder flute",
            "wooden fife",
            "baroque recorder instrument"
          ],
          "kind": "cutout",
          "at": "played…",
          "id": "s10-object"
        }
      },
      "sfx": [
        {
          "id": "piper-flute",
          "at": "played…",
          "volume": 0.4,
          "durMs": 2600
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s11",
      "text": "to the river, / where every last one *drowned.*",
      "template": "photo-full",
      "slots": {
        "photo": {
          "see": "a dark river at dusk, cold flowing water, old stone bank",
          "find": [
            "dark river water flowing",
            "river night water",
            "river dusk"
          ],
          "kind": "video",
          "at": "start",
          "id": "s11-photo"
        }
      },
      "sfx": [
        {
          "id": "underwater",
          "at": "drowned.",
          "volume": 0.35,
          "durMs": 1800
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s12",
      "text": "But the mayor / ^refused^ to pay.",
      "template": "type-center"
    },
    {
      "id": "s13",
      "text": "So the piper / came back / one *morning,*",
      "template": "photo-full",
      "variant": 1,
      "slots": {
        "photo": {
          "see": "misty morning over the rooftops of an old half-timbered German town, no people",
          "find": [
            "hameln old town",
            "half timbered houses morning mist",
            "medieval german town morning"
          ],
          "kind": "photo",
          "at": "start",
          "id": "s13-photo"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s14",
      "text": "while the parents / were at / *church.*",
      "template": "split-panel",
      "slots": {
        "photo": {
          "see": "inside an old church, anonymous people sitting in the pews seen from behind, candles",
          "find": [
            "church congregation from behind",
            "people in church pews back",
            "old church interior people praying"
          ],
          "kind": "photo",
          "at": "start",
          "id": "s14-photo"
        }
      },
      "sfx": [
        {
          "id": "church-bell",
          "at": "church.",
          "volume": 0.4
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s15",
      "text": "He played / a *different song.*",
      "template": "photo-framed",
      "slots": {
        "photo": {
          "see": "close-up of a man's hands playing a wooden flute, dark background, no face",
          "find": [
            "hands playing wooden flute",
            "playing flute close up hands",
            "recorder flute hands"
          ],
          "kind": "photo",
          "at": "start",
          "id": "s15-photo"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s16",
      "text": "Doors flew open. / Little *feet* / ran into the street.",
      "template": "photo-full",
      "transition": "whip-left",
      "slots": {
        "photo": {
          "see": "small bare feet of children running on old cobblestones, motion, no faces",
          "find": [
            "children feet running cobblestones",
            "kids bare feet running",
            "children running feet"
          ],
          "kind": "photo",
          "at": "start",
          "id": "s16-photo"
        }
      },
      "sfx": [
        {
          "id": "door-creak",
          "at": "Doors",
          "volume": 0.45,
          "durMs": 1200
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s17",
      "text": "Every child / in Hamelin / *followed* / him,",
      "template": "split-panel",
      "variant": 1,
      "slots": {
        "photo": {
          "see": "silhouettes of a line of children walking away up a path, seen from behind, backlit, no faces",
          "find": [
            "children walking away silhouette",
            "kids walking path from behind",
            "children silhouette walking"
          ],
          "kind": "photo",
          "at": "start",
          "id": "s17-photo"
        }
      },
      "sfx": [
        {
          "id": "children-laugh",
          "at": "followed",
          "volume": 0.22,
          "durMs": 2200
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s18",
      "text": "through the gate, / up the *hill…*",
      "template": "photo-full",
      "variant": 1,
      "slots": {
        "photo": {
          "see": "a path climbing toward a misty hill at dusk, no people",
          "find": [
            "path up hill fog",
            "foggy hill path dusk",
            "misty hillside trail"
          ],
          "kind": "photo",
          "at": "start",
          "id": "s18-photo"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s19",
      "text": "and they were / never seen *again.*",
      "template": "type-center",
      "transition": "cut",
      "quiet": true
    },
    {
      "id": "s20",
      "text": "Only one *lame* boy / was left behind.",
      "template": "object-hero",
      "variant": 2,
      "slots": {
        "object": {
          "see": "the lame child on crutches — an illustration of the legend",
          "find": [
            "The Lame Child pied piper illustration"
          ],
          "kind": "cutout",
          "at": "lame",
          "id": "s20-object"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s21",
      "text": "He couldn't / _keep up._",
      "template": "type-center",
      "variant": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "s22",
      "text": "But the oldest records / never mention / a single *rat.*",
      "template": "photo-framed",
      "transition": "blur-dissolve",
      "slots": {
        "photo": {
          "see": "the oldest picture of the Pied Piper (1592 copy of the Hamelin church window): the piper in a striped many-coloured costume, the children on the hill, the town, the river — no rats",
          "find": [
            "Pied piper.jpg Moersperg 1592"
          ],
          "kind": "photo",
          "at": "records",
          "id": "s22-photo"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s23",
      "text": "The rats were added / almost *three hundred* years later.",
      "template": "type-center",
      "slots": {
        "bigWord": "300"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s24",
      "text": "The children / were *not.*",
      "template": "outro-hold",
      "transition": "blur-dissolve",
      "slots": {
        "object": {
          "see": "a pair of small old worn children's leather shoes, antique",
          "find": [
            "old children's shoes",
            "antique child shoes",
            "vintage worn baby shoes"
          ],
          "kind": "cutout",
          "at": "children",
          "id": "s24-object"
        }
      },
      "sfx": [
        {
          "id": "sub-drop",
          "at": "not.",
          "volume": 0.45
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
